ntreal.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm going to have to make that gravy first!", "id": 2, "time": "15700", "image": "engenn6le16ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You mean it's not ready? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I needed to wait until I could get some juice from the meat. The gravy has got to thicken before I can add it to the dish.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Alright \u2026 Let me get a few bottles of beer and wine ready just in case. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  A couple of pitchers of juice would be nice, too.", "id": 3, "time": "37100", "image": "engenn6le16ob06re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le16ob06re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}